{
  "doc": "M3-C08-02 greybox: ch08/coilspire (act1_ch08.md B03-B07). North is -z. From the wall-gate (PathFoot, the south end) the headland path runs north between wind-bent scrub (random fights, and one forced fight at the mid-point) to a small plaza at the spire's foot: the keeper's hut and its hearth on the west (Fenn, B03), the spire door north (the Tender, B04). Inside, the hollow spire is laid out flat, tier after tier northward: four tiers (t1-t4), each with its flue-keys (Key_<key>, interact; Ch08CoilspireZone) and its brazier (Flame_<tier>), and a gate (Gate_<tier>) that opens when the flame climbs past it; tier 2 has the side flue (west wall) and the sealed lamp-niche (NicheSeal); tier 3 the seized key Liss frees. Two placed fights: tier 2's landing and tier 4's. Gate_t4 is the crown chamber's door: beyond it, Virel's chamber and the beacon gallery, which looks south-west at the storm wall (shown once Virel is bound). states (Ch04Zone): the party and the Tender inside after the door, the party in the gallery after the binding. states_when (Ch08Zone): Fenn in the gallery when he fed the beacon with Asha. Env-art's Coilspire kit (act1_ch08.md §9 Environment Art 3) replaces the blocks.",
